WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:05.200
This flexible pink robot contains no rigid motors

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.020
Each module has three air bladders

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.660
connected to tubes.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:11.120
The tubes suck air out to make them contract

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.140
bending the robot in that direction.

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:19.260
Add a suction cup and it can pick up objects.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:24.900
Add two and it can climb up walls.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.480
It can also crawl like an inchworm

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:31.300
or roll like a log.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.040
A single tube and wire run down its length

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:36.520
Soft robots are safe for people to use.

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:38.880
And they are easy to make.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:42.380
It’s not an insult to say these bots really suck.

